/ Introduction to Programming, 2nd Ed 1970
/ Figure 5-9  Routine to Print One Word

*200
	JMS	HELLO
	HLT

HELLO,  0			/ Print hello subroutine
	CLA CLL
	TLS			/ Set printer flag
	TAD	CHARAC		/ Setup index register
	DCA	IR1		/ For getting characters
	TAD	M6		/ Setup counter for...
	DCA	COUNT		/ Typing characters

NEXT,	TAD I	IR1		/ Get a character
	JMS	TYPE		/ Type it
	ISZ	COUNT		/ Done yet?
	JMP	NEXT		/ No
	JMP I	HELLO		/ Yes; return

TYPE,	0			/ Type subroutine
	TSF
	JMP	.-1
	TLS
	CLA
	JMP I	TYPE

CHARAC,	.			/ Initial value of IR1
	310			/ H
	305			/ E
	314			/ L
	314			/ L
	317			/ O
	241			/ !
M6,	-6
COUNT,	0
IR1=10
$
